{{!
    @template tool_vae/positioning_page

    The page of a rank, under its heading (certify.php, evaluate.php): the sentence that says a positioning is not a
    validation, the record and the label of the rank, the error of a send, the competencies of the bloc that are not yet
    sufficient, the form with its sentence for whoever may write, the heading of the history and the history, the way back
    to the dossier.

    Every text comes from the context, already worded by tool_vae\output\positioning_page. The template holds no logic.
    Every value is escaped (double braces) except these keys:
    * errorhtml - the error of a send, a notification of the core (its message escaped by the class), or empty
    * alerthtml - the competencies that are not yet sufficient, a notification of the core (its message escaped by the
      class), or empty
    * formhtml - the form, drawn by the core (moodleform::render())
    * historyheadinghtml - the heading of the history, drawn by the core
    * historyhtml - the history of the rank, drawn by the template tool_vae/positioning_history

    Classes required for JS:
    * none

    Data attributes required for JS:
    * none

    Context variables required for this template:
    * disclaimer - string, the sentence that says a positioning is not a validation
    * fichecode, label - string, the record and the label of the rank
    * errorhtml, alerthtml - string, HTML of the core, or empty
    * form - object or null: intro (the sentence above the form), formhtml (HTML of the core)
    * historyheadinghtml, historyhtml - string, HTML of the core and of a template
    * backurl, back - string, the way back to the dossier

    Example context (json):
    {
        "disclaimer": "It is not a validation: only the jury validates, outside this platform.",
        "fichecode": "RNCP100",
        "label": "Bloc 1",
        "errorhtml": "",
        "alerthtml": "<div class=\"alert alert-warning\">Not yet sufficient: Help to eat</div>",
        "form": {"intro": "Certify this bloc.", "formhtml": "<form action=\"#\" method=\"post\"><p>The form.</p></form>"},
        "historyheadinghtml": "<h3>History</h3>",
        "historyhtml": "<p class=\"text-muted\">No line yet.</p>",
        "backurl": "https://example.com/admin/tool/vae/dossier.php?userid=7",
        "back": "Back to the dossier"
    }
}}
<p class="text-muted small">{{disclaimer}}</p>{{!
}}<p><strong>{{fichecode}}</strong> - {{label}}</p>{{!
}}{{{errorhtml}}}{{{alerthtml}}}{{#form}}<p>{{intro}}</p>{{{formhtml}}}{{/form}}{{!
}}{{{historyheadinghtml}}}{{{historyhtml}}}{{!
}}<p><a href="{{backurl}}">{{back}}</a></p>
